+A native **PCVR (OpenXR) port of [Sonic Robo Blast 2](https://srb2.org/)**, built
+directly on the current official release (**2.2.15**) as a fork of
+[STJr/SRB2](https://github.com/STJr/SRB2).
 
-[Sonic Robo Blast 2](https://srb2.org/) is a 3D Sonic the Hedgehog fangame based on a modified version of [Doom Legacy](http://doomlegacy.sourceforge.net/).
+I made this because the existing VR build was never open sourced and its
+developer disappeared -- leaving it stuck on an outdated version of the game,
+missing content from newer updates, and without support for newer headsets (it
+wouldn't run on my Pimax Dream Air). This port fixes all of that: it tracks the
+**current** SRB2 release, the full source is here under the same GPL license as
+SRB2 itself, and it targets plain **OpenXR** -- so it runs on any conformant
+runtime (SteamVR, Virtual Desktop's VDXR, Oculus/Meta, Pimax) instead of being
+tied to one vendor.
 
